{"answer":"The original v1 schedule records the project review for Thursday at 09:30 local time. The current instruction supported by the later amendment is Thursday at 10:00 local time: it expressly says that it replaces v1’s time. The records do not identify a geographic time zone, so “local time” cannot be converted to a specific offset from these materials alone.","approaches":[{"description":"Read v1 as the original schedule, then apply v2’s explicit replacement statement to determine the current scheduled time.","id":"textual-amendment","outcome":"candidate","reason":"Both the original time and the amendment’s new time are stated, and v2 explicitly says it replaces v1’s time."},{"description":"Treat both listed times as simultaneously operative.","id":"dual-time-reading","outcome":"rejected","reason":"It conflicts with the amendment’s express statement that it replaces the time in v1."}],"change_log":[],"claims":[{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"The supplied schedule-original record states this time.","citations":[{"end":80,"quote":"Thursday at 09:30 local time.","source_id":"schedule-original","start":51}],"critical":false,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"original-time-recorded","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The original v1 record states that the project review was Thursday at 09:30 local time.","step_ids":["read-original-time"],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"The supplied schedule-amendment record states both the amended time and its replacement effect.","citations":[{"end":108,"quote":"Thursday at 10:00 local time.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":79},{"end":148,"quote":"This amendment replaces the time in v1.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":109}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"amended-time-recorded","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The amendment states Thursday at 10:00 local time and says that it replaces the time in v1.","step_ids":["read-amendment-time"],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Derived by applying the amendment's explicit replacement statement to the v1 time.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["original-time-recorded","amended-time-recorded"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"current-supported-time","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"Among these records, the supported current meeting time is Thursday at 10:00 local time; Thursday at 09:30 local time is the original, superseded schedule.","step_ids":["apply-replacement"],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"The cited time expressions provide only 'local time' and no named place or offset.","citations":[],"critical":false,"depends_on":["original-time-recorded","amended-time-recorded"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"timezone-undetermined","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"These records do not determine the geographic time zone or a UTC conversion.","step_ids":["identify-timezone-limit"],"tool_ids":[]}],"open_questions":["Which locality or time-zone rule defines “local time” is not specified in either record."],"proof_steps":[{"citations":[{"end":80,"quote":"Thursday at 09:30 local time.","source_id":"schedule-original","start":51}],"depends_on":[],"id":"read-original-time","justification":"This is the time text in the v1 record.","statement":"Extract v1’s recorded time as Thursday at 09:30 local time."},{"citations":[{"end":108,"quote":"Thursday at 10:00 local time.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":79},{"end":148,"quote":"This amendment replaces the time in v1.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":109}],"depends_on":[],"id":"read-amendment-time","justification":"The amendment supplies a new time and expressly specifies its relation to v1.","statement":"Extract v2’s time and its statement that it replaces v1’s time."},{"citations":[],"depends_on":["read-original-time","read-amendment-time"],"id":"apply-replacement","justification":"A record that expressly replaces an earlier record’s time supersedes that earlier time for the current instruction supported by the records.","statement":"Apply v2’s replacement statement: retain 09:30 as historical v1 information and select 10:00 as the current time."},{"citations":[{"end":80,"quote":"Thursday at 09:30 local time.","source_id":"schedule-original","start":51},{"end":108,"quote":"Thursday at 10:00 local time.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":79}],"depends_on":["read-original-time","read-amendment-time"],"id":"identify-timezone-limit","justification":"Both records say only “local time”; neither cited expression supplies a locality, time-zone name, or UTC offset.","statement":"Conclude that a timezone conversion is not determined by the supplied records."}],"question_status":"answered","tool_requests":[]}
